{"page": 6, "segments": [{"index": 0, "text": "Height: \u0398(lg n) for n-element heap. Leaves: indices \u230an/2\u230b+1 \u2026 n.", "rects": [[62.25, 56.24958038330078, 460.2076110839844, 70.34957885742188]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/ac17fccd/pages/6/audio/seg_0000.wav", "duration": 6.4}, {"index": 1, "text": "MAX-HEAPIFY(A, i)", "rects": [[62.25, 82.34723663330078, 193.8179931640625, 96.44723510742188], [91.14601135253906, 368.076904296875, 213.95404052734375, 382.0448913574219]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/ac17fccd/pages/6/audio/seg_0001.wav", "duration": 2.175}, {"index": 2, "text": "l = LEFT(i) = 2i\nr = RIGHT(i) = 2i+1\nif l \u2264 A.heap-size and A[l] > A[i]   largest = l\nelse largest = i\nif r \u2264 A.heap-size and A[r] > A[largest]   largest = r\nif largest \u2260 i\n    swap A[i] with A[largest]\n    MAX-HEAPIFY(A, largest)", "rects": [[62.25, 108.44798278808594, 177.83404541015625, 122.41598510742188], [62.25, 122.41673278808594, 199.50604248046875, 136.38473510742188], [62.25, 136.38548278808594, 409.0018310546875, 150.35348510742188], [62.25, 150.35423278808594, 177.83404541015625, 164.32223510742188], [62.25, 164.32298278808594, 452.345947265625, 178.29098510742188], [62.25, 178.29173278808594, 163.3860321044922, 192.25973510742188], [62.25, 192.26048278808594, 271.7459716796875, 206.22848510742188], [62.25, 206.22923278808594, 257.2979736328125, 220.19723510742188]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/ac17fccd/pages/6/audio/seg_0002.wav", "duration": 26.45}, {"index": 3, "text": "Complexity: O(lg n). Worst-case 2n/3 occurs at root of a tree where\nbottom half-full.\nRecurrence T(n) \u2264 T(2n/3) + O(1) \u2192 O(lg n) by Master Theorem Case 2.\nLoop invariant version: at start of each iteration, A[i] may be smaller\nthan children; after swap, property holds for subtree rooted at largest.", "rects": [[92.25, 232.19798278808594, 501.630126953125, 246.16598510742188], [92.25, 246.16673278808594, 189.67799377441406, 260.1347351074219], [92.25, 260.135498046875, 530.550048828125, 274.1034851074219], [92.25, 274.104248046875, 511.9980773925781, 288.0722351074219], [92.25, 288.072998046875, 523.7940673828125, 302.0409851074219]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/ac17fccd/pages/6/audio/seg_0003.wav", "duration": 26.75}, {"index": 4, "text": "BUILD-MAX-HEAP(A, n)", "rects": [[62.25, 314.03863525390625, 225.53396606445312, 328.1386413574219], [62.25, 488.018310546875, 206.73004150390625, 501.9862976074219]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/ac17fccd/pages/6/audio/seg_0004.wav", "duration": 2.05}, {"index": 5, "text": "A.heap-size = n\nfor i = \u230an/2\u230b down to 1\n    MAX-HEAPIFY(A, i)", "rects": [[62.25, 340.139404296875, 170.61004638671875, 354.1073913574219], [62.25, 354.108154296875, 228.40200805664062, 368.0761413574219], [62.25, 368.076904296875, 213.95404052734375, 382.0448913574219]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/ac17fccd/pages/6/audio/seg_0005.wav", "duration": 7.075}, {"index": 6, "text": "Complexity: O(n). Proof: \u03a3_{h=0}^{\u230alg n\u230b} \u2308n/2^{h+1}\u2309\u00b7O(h) = O(n\u00b7\u03a3\nh/2^h) = O(n).\nKey insight: MAX-HEAPIFY on node of height h takes O(h), and there\nare \u2264 \u2308n/2^{h+1}\u2309 such nodes.", "rects": [[92.25, 394.045654296875, 523.0501098632812, 408.0136413574219], [92.25, 408.014404296875, 182.5500030517578, 421.9823913574219], [92.25, 421.983154296875, 513.9780883789062, 435.9511413574219], [92.25, 435.951904296875, 285.1020202636719, 449.9198913574219]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/ac17fccd/pages/6/audio/seg_0006.wav", "duration": 20.0}, {"index": 7, "text": "HEAPSORT(A, n)", "rects": [[62.25, 461.91754150390625, 176.62200927734375, 476.0175476074219]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/ac17fccd/pages/6/audio/seg_0007.wav", "duration": 1.875}, {"index": 8, "text": "BUILD-MAX-HEAP(A, n)\nfor i = n down to 2\n    swap A[1] with A[i]\n    A.heap-size = A.heap-size - 1\n    MAX-HEAPIFY(A, 1)", "rects": [[62.25, 488.018310546875, 206.73004150390625, 501.9862976074219], [62.25, 501.987060546875, 199.50604248046875, 515.9550170898438], [62.25, 515.955810546875, 228.40200805664062, 529.9237670898438], [62.25, 529.924560546875, 300.6419372558594, 543.8925170898438], [62.25, 543.893310546875, 213.95404052734375, 557.8612670898438]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/ac17fccd/pages/6/audio/seg_0008.wav", "duration": 11.4}, {"index": 9, "text": "Complexity: O(n lg n) \u2014 BUILD-MAX-HEAP O(n) + (n-1)\u00b7MAX-HEAPIFY\ncalls each O(lg n).\nLoop invariant: A[1:i] is max-heap containing i smallest elements;\nA[i+1:n] contains n-i largest in sorted order.\nNot stable. In-place.", "rects": [[92.25, 569.862060546875, 527.9100952148438, 583.8300170898438], [92.25, 583.830810546875, 202.3739776611328, 597.7987670898438], [92.25, 597.799560546875, 492.0780334472656, 611.7675170898438], [92.25, 611.768310546875, 362.2381286621094, 625.7362670898438], [92.25, 625.737060546875, 215.83802795410156, 639.7050170898438]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/ac17fccd/pages/6/audio/seg_0009.wav", "duration": 19.975}, {"index": 10, "text": "Priority Queues: - HEAP-MAXIMUM(A): return A[1]. \u0398(1). - HEAP-\nEXTRACT-MAX(A): max = A[1]; A[1] = A[A.heap-size]; heap-size\u2013; MAX-\nHEAPIFY(A,1). O(lg n). - HEAP-INCREASE-KEY(A, i, key): A[i] = key;\nwhile i>1 and A[PARENT(i)] < A[i], swap up. O(lg n).", "rects": [[62.25, 651.7026977539062, 491.0484924316406, 665.8026733398438], [62.25, 665.8003540039062, 510.3128662109375, 679.9003295898438], [62.25, 680.030029296875, 500.40496826171875, 693.9979858398438], [62.25, 694.127685546875, 385.1220397949219, 708.0956420898438]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/ac17fccd/pages/6/audio/seg_0010.wav", "duration": 22.6}, {"index": 11, "text": "- MAX-HEAP-\nINSERT(A, key): heap-size++; A[heap-size] = -\u221e; HEAP-INCREASE-KEY(A,\nheap-size, key). O(lg n). - Min-priority queue: symmetric operations (HEAP-\nMINIMUM, HEAP-EXTRACT-MIN, HEAP-DECREASE-KEY, MIN-HEAP-\nINSERT).", "rects": [[388.93804931640625, 693.9956665039062, 476.41